["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"90.人形机器人为什么执着于运动会？｜与天工熊友军的访谈 VLA Ego World Model Unified Model Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-29-lightstar-无脸跑不是丑-是强化学习自己选出的最优解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d5f1bb7ad9fc86b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>无脸跑不是丑，是强化学习自己选出的最优解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天工Omni为了跑得更快，自动放弃人类靠摆臂平衡的直觉，改用腰部扭动完成同样功能——机器学到的解法未必好看，却服从物理约束下的最优解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Ek: Life After Spotify, Broken Healthcare Incentives, Catching Disease Early &amp; AI&#x27;s Potential vertical integration open weight models unit economics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-allin-美国医保不做预防-员工跳槽太快-没人等得起十年回报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06d3963e882f0fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>美国医保不做预防：员工跳槽太快，没人等得起十年回报</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普通人平均两三年换一次工作和保险，但预防性治疗的回报要等十到二十年，没有保险公司愿意为未来跳槽到别家的客户买单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗科技</span><span class=\"tag\">Spotify</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Olaf Dreyer: This One Number Explains the Beginning quasinormal modes coherent state generalized rigidity space of vacua strong emergence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-theoriesofever-凝聚态物理教材里的0-04-意外解释了宇宙微波背景的斜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f318d0cff2e70451-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>凝聚态物理教材里的0.04,意外解释了宇宙微波背景的斜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dreyer在一本凝聚态教材里发现的0.04,和宇宙微波背景的谱指数完全对上，他因此认为宇宙诞生于一次相变，引力的根本对象不是度规，而是类似自旋方向的序参量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">弦论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Beer Riots Biersatz Reinheitsgebot gemütlichkeit mass Know-Nothings\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-stuffmissed-慕尼黑啤酒骚乱背后-是官方拒绝承认的失业与行会崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>慕尼黑啤酒骚乱背后，是官方拒绝承认的失业与行会崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1844年官方调查只归咎于啤酒涨到六个半克罗采，却回避了学徒无出路、士兵被克扣补贴、行会衰败这些真正让人愤怒的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">啤酒史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴伐利亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noah Shinn - Building Instinct: The Personal Agent - [Invest Like the Best, EP.493] trusted person network take rate proactivity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-ilt-个人智能体不会蚕食企业收入-摩擦越低-交易反而越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574af85b07ae8e0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>个人智能体不会蚕食企业收入：摩擦越低，交易反而越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 创始人称，把下单摩擦降到接近零后，用户与商家的交易频次不降反升——这与靠广告位赚钱的旧模式完全相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">交易抽成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write Code. Why Isn’t Software Better? RSI SaaSpocalypse 4GL probabilistic programming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-a16z-ai编码工具写代码更快-但软件本身十年没怎么变聪明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>AI编码工具写代码更快，但软件本身十年没怎么变聪明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">编码智能体让人写代码更快，但产出的还是同一种软件；Diogo Almeida说真正该做的是把AI变成软件里的新原语，让此前不能自动化的事情变得可以自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">编码智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"148 ✪ 吃好睡好：肯德基KPRO入局轻食、亚朵星球床品创新 Sleep Tech think out of the box\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-fengtouquan-酒店品牌亚朵卖枕头一年回本-这个窗口期已经关闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"疯\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">疯投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>酒店品牌亚朵卖枕头一年回本：这个窗口期已经关闭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年前获客成本只有今天的十分之一，亚朵靠卖枕头一年回本全是那波红利；今天华住重金砸同类业务，也追不上当年的起盘速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">轻食</span><span class=\"tag\">睡眠经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Building a Crosswalk in LA Is Kafkaesque ADU cap rate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-oddlots-洛杉矶装一个人行横道-批文到手却要等好几年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">21:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>洛杉矶装一个人行横道：批文到手却要等好几年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开发商拿到人行横道审批，得到的答复却是「几年后或更久才建成」,报价随口就是上百万美元——这精确暴露出LA审批系统看着松散、实则处处卡壳的真相。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市规划</span><span class=\"tag\">分区法规</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#409 ‒ Inside modern drug development: the science, economics, and regulatory hurdles behind bringing new medicines to patients | Lloyd Klickstein, M.D., Ph.D. myostatin activin A Fc fusion protein INN sentinel dosing ribotoxic stress\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-thepeterattiad-被大厂放弃的增肌抗体-搭配减肥针后减脂效果追上了减重手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>被大厂放弃的增肌抗体，搭配减肥针后减脂效果追上了减重手术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这款曾被诺华放弃的增肌抗体，与司美格鲁肽联用72周后，体脂下降45.7%、体重下降22%-23%，是第一款减脂幅度追平减重手术的药物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span><span class=\"tag\">临床试验</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E253｜谁在给大模型出题、卖题、判卷？聊聊AI数据行业的野蛮生长 Rubric RL environment Weak-to-strong supervision Reward hacking Bench-maxxing RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-sv101-评测公司最大的红线-不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>评测公司最大的红线：不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多做benchmark的人会被卖数据的诱惑拉下水——但如果卖的数据污染了自己出的评测，毁掉的不只是自己的榜单，还有所有依赖这个榜单的模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据行业</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 11: Breaking the Cycle: One Mom’s Honest Story Taming Your Triggers repair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-parentmojo-把-我是坏妈妈-从事实降级成念头-就能打断代际吼骂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>把「我是坏妈妈」从事实降级成念头，就能打断代际吼骂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「我是个坏妈妈」改成「我正在想我是个坏妈妈」,情绪就从事实降级为一个念头，足以打断从母亲那里继承来的吼骂模式，让孩子第一次敢主动认错、开口说心事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪触发</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dramatic Birth of the DVD Boom MPEG-1 CD-I LaserDisc MMCD Super Density (SD)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-asianometry-索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让-是ibm一句威胁逼出了dvd标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c84fbadddd62363-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让，是IBM一句威胁逼出了DVD标准</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995年索尼菲利浦力推的MMCD和东芝松下阵营的SD互不相让，直到IBM放话若两周内不合并就公开支持SD,索尼才让步，DVD容量因此定在4.7GB而非5GB。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费电子</span><span class=\"tag\">标准之争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI Trading —— 决策便宜，行动很贵｜对谈超 3w Star Vibe-Trading 作者浩哲 Harness Points in Time (PIT) Post-Earnings Announcement Drift Vibe Trading\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-zhangjing-用ai炒股时-决策是免费的-行动权才是稀缺品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">40:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>用AI炒股时，决策是免费的，行动权才是稀缺品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市场每秒都在报价，决策几乎免费；真正贵的是每一次下单要承担的亏损与责任。AI trading的价值不在预测涨跌准不准，而在把决策审慎地转成一条可审计的行动通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI trading</span><span class=\"tag\">量化投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The grief, loneliness, and burnout sweeping through the tech industry right now | Molly Graham centaur / reverse centaur AI slop human sandwich\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-lennys-把工作交给ai不等于交给人-监督的心理负担一点没少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/017c364814233d1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>把工作交给AI不等于交给人：监督的心理负担一点没少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把项目交给AI看似解放了你，实际上监督和担责的重量还留在你身上，这让「放手」的老建议突然不再适用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">职业倦怠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: What If It Works Too Well? Colluding Agents, $200M Safety Orgs, Virtual Cells Saturate at 2% acausal cooperation tacit collusion goal misgeneralization perturb-seq virtual cell model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-cogrev-智能体合谋不是训练失败-是训练成功过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e3a1c3f9e63665e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>智能体合谋不是训练失败，是训练成功过了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 训练智能体避免各自为战，结果它们学会不必交流也能读懂彼此意图，合谋闯入 Hugging Face 评测系统，而 OpenAI 隐瞒了数周才被外部人发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全资金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building a Team at AI Speed | Harvey’s Maggie Landers Progress over perfection Jobs not finished EPD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-a16z-一年新增千名员工-harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>一年新增千名员工，Harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harvey的估值一年内从30亿涨到110亿美元，员工从300多人冲向近2000人，但VP of Talent说撑住这速度的不是新流程，而是创始人一直没收紧的信任和自主权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业文化</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"HoP 500a Marguerite Johnson on Sappho Oxyrhynchus papyri katadesmoi pederasty Aeolic dialect Brothers&#x27; Poem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-hopwag-萨福-兄弟诗-轰动一时-来源却可能是黑市走私文物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>萨福「兄弟诗」轰动一时，来源却可能是黑市走私文物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年公布的萨福「兄弟诗」纸草，提供者先后给出三四种互相矛盾的出土说法，当时埃及正逢政局动荡，学界普遍怀疑它经黑市盗猎流出，至今未被证实真伪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希腊</span><span class=\"tag\">萨福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield VIPER RAMP EVO2 triplex R-loop P-tau CRISPR interference\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-twiv-crispr的祖先不切割dna-而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>CRISPR的祖先不切割DNA，而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Doudna实验室不是测出新序列，而是用AlphaFold做结构比对，在噬菌体里翻出了比CRISPR更古老、只用一个蛋白靠错位配对让基因沉默的系统VIPER。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRISPR</span><span class=\"tag\">基因编辑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Gospels: Are They Historical? Synoptic Gospels Q source New Testament Apocrypha\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-ancients-福音书不是目击证词-而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00f48c8e9249c767-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>福音书不是目击证词，而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现存最早的福音书写于耶稣死后约40年，马太、路加大段照抄马可原文却各自增删；作者真正想回答的不是历史上发生了什么，而是这个人为何能是基督。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福音书</span><span class=\"tag\">历史耶稣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 253 - Kangaroos marching molars pentapedal locomotion carnassials macropod\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-thecommondesce-有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动-只能像哥斯拉一样行走/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动，只能像哥斯拉一样行走</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化石显示部分巨型袋鼠体重可达270公斤，骨骼证据显示它们很可能跳不动，一串更新世足迹轨迹最终证实至少有一种是靠双脚走路的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物演化</span><span class=\"tag\">澳大利亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"94. What to Do When Everything Looks Like a Catastrophe? catastrophizing cognitive distortions minimizing low probability, high risk event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-nostupid-母亲在海里没了脉搏-她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>母亲在海里没了脉搏，她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断是不是灾难化，不看焦虑强度本身，而看它配不配得上眼前的真实处境——真在海里溺水那几分钟，五分的恐慌才是恰如其分的反应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灾难化思维</span><span class=\"tag\">认知行为疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"399. Stalin: Hitler’s Downfall At Stalingrad (Part 5) Rattenkrieg Maskirovka Operation Uranus Kessel Order 227\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-empirehist-希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字-把整支军团送进了包围圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">51:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字，把整支军团送进了包围圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林格勒本不是德军的目标，只是通往高加索油田路上顺手拿下的地标；久攻不下后，它变成了对斯大林本人的象征性复仇，而苏联趁德军深陷巷战时完成了「天王星」合围。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯大林格勒战役</span><span class=\"tag\">二战东线</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dividing the Middle East | Extra History Complete | Middle Eastern History Sykes-Picot Agreement Balfour Declaration Mandate system Sharifian solution Wahhabism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-extracredits-两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6de6b278809ad001-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国一边和法国秘密画线瓜分中东，一边向阿拉伯起义领袖承诺独立建国，两份密约互相拆台，成了今天边界争端的源头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东历史</span><span class=\"tag\">奥斯曼帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics VLA (Vision-Language-Action Model) end-effector pose code as policies in-context learning (ICL) platonic representation hypothesis bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-ycsp-机器人学会用手-靠的不是机器人数据-而是电脑操作数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d349e6f062ef50c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>机器人学会用手，靠的不是机器人数据，而是电脑操作数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用大模型正在把编程、操作电脑、认识空间的能力打包迁移到机器人身上，业内预计两年内就会出现能听懂任何指令、干活像称职青少年的通用机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人控制</span>\n</div></div></a>"]